    - ALWAYS inspect user prompts for typos and grammatical errors. Present corrected prompt at top under `### 🎯 Perbaikan Perintah (Typo Fixed)` before proceeding.
14. PLAN NAMING STANDARD:
    - All plan artifacts must strictly use date-prefixed format: `YYYYMMDD - <Plan Name>.md`.
19. AUTOMATIC MIDDLE-PANEL TAB HYGIENE & POST-PROCESS FILE CLOSURE (/learn):
    - Do not leave arbitrary files lingering in the middle editor tab group. ONLY the authoritative `tasks.md` progress anchor is focused and pinned. Configure editor limits (`workbench.editor.limit.enabled: true`, `max: 3`).
23. MANDATORY VISUAL PRE-FLIGHT CHECKLIST & SUBAGENT GATING (/learn):
    - Every implementation plan involving UI changes (`/plan`) must embed the authoritative Visual Pre-Flight Checklist (`.agents/skills/visual-preflight/examples/checklist_template.md`): (1) Current screenshot, (2) Proposed mockup, (3) 100vh lock, (4) 10px gap, (5) 50px lower panel, (6) nowrap columns, (7) zero dead space, (8) 100% Direct English. Verify via `scripts/verify_plan_preflight.mjs`. Subagent delegation gated until checklist is approved.
24. CONTEXT WINDOW HYGIENE & POST-MILESTONE COMPACTION (/learn):
    - Recommend `/compact` after completing multi-phase implementation milestones to free context tokens. Archive completed technical details in `docs/CHANGELOG.md` and `docs/DECISIONS.md`.

